<InfoPage title="About us" description="A clearer way to see what people are talking about." canonical="https://trendingnews.vercel.app/about">
  <p>Trending Topic helps readers explore subjects attracting attention in India. We bring trend snapshots, time based views, and related coverage together so you can move from a topic’s momentum to the stories behind it.</p>
  <h2>How to use the site</h2>
  <p>Browse the homepage for a current overview, compare topics across time periods, or search for a subject. Topic pages collect trend signals and related stories to give you more context.</p>
  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <p>Trend scores and momentum indicators are intended as discovery signals. They are not a measure of truth, importance, or the quality of reporting. We encourage readers to open the linked coverage and consider its sources and context.</p>
</InfoPage>
